1
00:00:00,892 --> 00:00:02,892
(Sheldon:)More?

2
00:00:03,353 --> 00:00:04,393
(Leonard:)I'm afraid so.

3
00:00:04,562 --> 00:00:07,022
(Leonard:)You know the cashew chicken
I get you on Monday nights?

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,860
Yes, from Szechwan Palace.

5
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:12,740
Szechwan Palace closed two years ago.

6
00:00:15,323 --> 00:00:16,863
(Penny:)What?

7
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:20,703
- Where did my cashew chicken come from?
- Golden Dragon.

8
00:00:26,084 --> 00:00:27,754
(Leonard:)No.

9
00:00:30,046 --> 00:00:31,716
(Sheldon:)No, this isn't right.

10
00:00:31,881 --> 00:00:35,171
No, our food always comes
in Szechwan Palace containers.

11
00:00:35,343 --> 00:00:40,183
(Leonard:)Yeah, well, before they went out of
business, I bought 4000 containers.

12
00:00:41,766 --> 00:00:44,016
(Leonard:)I keep them in the trunk of my car.

13
00:00:45,061 --> 00:00:46,391
(Howard:)But...

14
00:00:47,438 --> 00:00:49,938
(Sheldon:)Oh, this changes everything.

15
00:00:51,568 --> 00:00:54,448
(Leonard:)I thought that might take
his mind off the cushion.

16
00:00:54,612 --> 00:00:57,952
(Sheldon:)What's real? What isn't?
How can I know?

17
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:04,020
- You did make that up, right?
- Oh, God, I wish I had.

